<title>PORTUGAL: Banco Comercial presents results Jan 28.</title>
<headline>Banco Comercial presents results Jan 28.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Comercial Portugues (BCP) will issue its 1996 results on January 28, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>Analysts' forecasts for the bank's net profit range from 20 to just over 22 billion escudos.</p>
<p>($1=158.08 escudos)</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
